        "description": "User reviews of a product on Kakaku.com: `id`, `title`, `url`, `rating`, `aspects` (per-aspect ratings), `date`, `author` (nickname), `author_reviews`, `text`, `helpful`. 15 a page; pass `next_page` back as `page`; null on the last page.\n\nEvery response includes `credits_used`: the credits this call cost.\n\nPrice: 1 credit per successful call. Docs: https://api.sh/docs/kakaku-reviews",
        "tags": [
          "Kakaku.com"
        ],
        "x-credits": 1,
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": true,
